# Styling and theme

- Every colour, font, radius, shadow and spacing value comes from tokens in `src/theme/`.
  Components never contain hex codes, `rgb()`, font family names or arbitrary Tailwind values like `bg-[#d4ff00]`.
- Use the semantic Tailwind classes mapped to tokens: `bg-surface`, `text-muted`, `border-line`, `bg-accent`, `font-display`.
- Themes: `street` (main app) and `retro` (Fantasy tab), each with `light` and `dark`.
  Switching theme or mode only changes the `data-theme` / `data-mode` attributes.
- If a design change needs edits in several components, a token is missing. Add the token instead.
- Icons only through `src/ui/icon.tsx` (Lucide underneath). No emoji as icons.

```tsx
// Bad
<div className="bg-[#0e0e0e] text-[#d4ff00] font-['Anton']">

// Good
<div className="bg-hero text-accent font-display">
```
